sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title UC1-A Operator creates and submits an application
    actor Op as Operator
    participant UI as React SPA
    participant API as FastAPI (api → services)
    participant WF as domain.workflow
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant FS as File storage
    participant BG as Background task
    participant AI as OpenAI (advisory)

    Op->>UI: New application
    UI->>API: POST /applications
    API->>DB: insert Application(status=draft)
    API-->>UI: 201 application (label "Draft")

    loop each section
        Op->>UI: fill section
        UI->>UI: Zod validation
        UI->>API: PATCH /applications/{id}/sections/{key}
        API->>API: Pydantic validation, editability check
        API->>DB: update draft_data
        API-->>UI: 200 section + completeness
    end

    Op->>UI: drop document (type)
    UI->>API: POST /applications/{id}/documents (multipart)
    API->>API: allowlist, size, magic bytes
    API->>FS: save bytes (server key)
    API->>DB: insert Document, VerificationRun(pending), audit document.uploaded
    API-->>UI: 201 document {verification: pending}
    API-)BG: run_verification(run_id)
    BG->>DB: run = running
    BG->>BG: extract text, injection heuristic
    BG->>AI: structured verification request (30 s timeout)
    AI-->>BG: JSON (schema-constrained)
    BG->>BG: Pydantic validate, deterministic rules
    BG->>DB: run = verified | issues_found | needs_review | unreadable | failed, audit verification.completed
    loop poll every 2 s while pending/running
        UI->>API: GET /applications/{id}
        API-->>UI: documents + verification status
    end

    Op->>UI: Submit
    UI->>API: POST /applications/{id}/submit
    API->>API: server-side completeness check
    API->>WF: transition(draft → application_received, operator, ctx)
    WF-->>API: ok
    API->>DB: insert Revision 1 (snapshot), status, audit revision.submitted + status.changed, notify officers (one transaction)
    API-->>UI: 200 application (label "Submitted")
